            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "1. This is most certainly due to case insensitive operating system: Windows or MacOS. Those treat file paths which differ only in letter cases as the same path.\r\n2. Not performing action that might damage existing files is by design. To override already existing file with the same name, delete present file first and then move/copy the new file.",
